  "title": "Stanley finds Livingstone at Ujiji",
  "summary": "The New York Herald sent journalist Henry Morton Stanley to find the missing explorer David Livingstone. Stanley left Bagamoyo on 21 March 1871 and reached Ujiji on Lake Tanganyika, where he met Livingstone. Sources give 27 October or 10 November 1871 for the meeting. Livingstone refused to return to Britain and died about eighteen months later.",
